{title: VELOMA MADINIDINIKA}
{artist: LEVELO}
{key: DO#}
{singers: Misa, Toky}
{musicians: Haja=Guitare, Toky=Guitare basse}
{youtube: 6c-4LgvO_aY}

{repeat: 2}
Hisaraka vetivety,
zahay nefa manantena
Fa tsy maintsy mbola hihaona
any aoriana
Samia velona aina
hifanatritava
(Ny) lalao mbola ho ela,
ny diavolan-ko lava
Veloma madinidinika ianareo
Masina ka samy tsara

{repeat: 2}
Hasampiko miankavia re ny lamba
Ny tongotra hamikavika
Fa lalàna tsy efa mora ny anay
No any ambadika lavitra any
Satry ny hijanona eto ô!
Hihira sy hikalokalo
Kanefa sao miandry
ny any an-tanàna
(Ny) lalao mbola ho ela,
ny diavolan-ko lava
Veloma madinidinika ianareo
Masina ka samy tsara

